12"><p class="w-full rounded-[32px] bg-background px-5 py-12 text-base leading-6">Weldica is an AI-driven conversational platform designed to revolutionize the welding industry by automating the welding procedure qualification process. By leveraging intelligent automation, Weldica simplifies compliance management, minimizes errors, and accelerates the certification process. This innovation empowers welding supervisors and project managers to streamline their workflows, reduce costs, and ensure compliance without the need for extensive manual intervention or third-party consultancy.</p></div><dl class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-[25px] py-8 leading-[22px]"><dt class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Industry</dt><dd class="text-sm">B2B SaaS</dd></div><div class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-[25px] py-8 leading-[22px]"><dt class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Position</dt><dd class="text-sm">Product Designer</dd></div><div class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-[25px] py-8 leading-[22px]"><dt class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Platforms</dt><dd class="text-sm">Web app</dd></div><div class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col justify-end gap-2 px-[25px] py-8 leading-[22px]"><dt class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Timeline</dt><dd class="text-sm">Project contract 2025</dd></div></dl></div></div><section id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-foreground/5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none relative h-px"><div class="absolute -inset-x-[129px] top-0 h-px bg-foreground/5"></div><span class="absolute top-0 grid size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background left-0 -translate-x-1/2"><span class="size-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span></span><span class="absolute top-0 grid size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background right-0 translate-x-1/2"><span class="size-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span></span></div><div class="px-6 pb-10 pt-24 md:px-12 lg:pt-40"><h2 id="problem-title" class="text-2xl font-medium leading-8 md:text-[32px] md:leading-[42px]">Problem</h2></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-foreground/5 flex flex-col gap-12 px-6 pb-24 pt-12 md:px-[41px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80">Welding companies face significant challenges in managing welding procedure qualifications, compliance documentation, and welder certifications. The current manual processes are labor-intensive, time-consuming, and prone to human errors, leading to increased costs and project delays.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><h3 class="text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80">Key challenges</h3><ul><li class="border-b border-foreground/5 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium leading-5 last:border-b-0">High operational costs due to manual workload.</li><li class="border-b border-foreground/5 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium leading-5 last:border-b-0">Increased risk of compliance errors and retesting.</li><li class="border-b border-foreground/5 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium leading-5 last:border-b-0">Inefficient document and qualification tracking.</li><li class="border-b border-foreground/5 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium leading-5 last:border-b-0">Dependency on third-party consultants for compliance verification.</li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80">Bottom line</h3><p class="text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80">Companies need a streamlined, cost-effective solution that ensures compliance while enhancing efficiency and reducing project delays.</p></div></div></section><section id="solution" aria-labelledby="solution-title"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-foreground/5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none relative h-px"><div class="absolute -inset-x-[129px] top-0 h-px bg-foreground/5"></div><span class="absolute top-0 grid size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background left-0 -translate-x-1/2"><span class="size-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span></span><span class="absolute top-0 grid size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background right-0 translate-x-1/2"><span class="size-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span></span></div><div class="px-6 pb-10 pt-24 md:px-12 lg:pt-40"><h2 id="solution-title" class="text-2xl font-medium leading-8 md:text-[32px] md:leading-[42px]">Solution</h2></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-foreground/5 flex flex-col gap-12 px-6 pb-24 pt-12 md:px-[41px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80">Weldica provides an end-to-end AI-powered platform that automates welding procedure qualification. By digitizing and optimizing the certification process, Weldica enables businesses to independently manage their compliance needs, from initial inquiry to final approval.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><h3 class="text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80">Core features</h3><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Conversational AI Assistance</h4><p class="text-sm">Guides users through the welding qualification process, offering real-time support.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Automated Compliance Checks</h4><p class="text-sm">Ensures adherence to CSA W47.1, AWS D1.1, and other industry standards.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Digital Document Management</h4><p class="text-sm">Centralizes and organizes welding qualification records, reducing paperwork.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Predictive Retesting Insights</h4><p class="text-sm">Reduces failure rates by identifying common issues before submission.</p></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><h3 class="text-[28px] font-medium leading-8 text-foreground/80">Primary user group persona</h3><div class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary grid gap-10 px-[25px] py-[39px] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div data-photo="true" class="group/photo transition-[filter,opacity] duration-500 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none [@media(hover:hover)]:group-has-[[data-photo]:hover]/photos:opacity-60 [@media(hover:hover)]:group-has-[[data-photo]:hover]/photos:blur-[3px] [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:!opacity-100 [@media(hover:hover)]:hover:!blur-none w-16 shrink-0"><div role="img" aria-label="Illustrated portrait used for the Steve persona" class="w-full rounded-[20px] bg-secondary" style="aspect-ratio:1"></div></div><div class="leading-[22px]"><p class="text-base font-medium">Steve</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Welding Supervisor in Project Management</p></div></div><dl class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm leading-[22px]"><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-foreground/5 pb-2"><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Location</dt><dd>Vancouver</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-foreground/5 pb-2"><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Tech proficiency</dt><dd>Low</dd></div></dl></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-sm leading-[22px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Goal</h4><ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><li>Expedite welding procedure approvals without compromising quality.</li><li>Improve efficiency and reduce reliance on third-party services.</li><li>Ensure compliance with CSA W47.1, AWS D1.1, and other standards.</li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Challenges</h4><ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><li>Lengthy processing times for welding certifications.</li><li>Challenges in finding reliable consultants.</li><li>Managing complex documentation and compliance workflows.</li></ul></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm leading-[22px]"><p class="text-foreground/80">Solution alignment: Weldica addresses Steve’s concerns by automating compliance workflows, reducing certification time, and providing an intuitive, AI-driven platform to manage welding qualifications effortlessly.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-foreground/5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none relative h-px"><div class="absolute -inset-x-[129px] top-0 h-px bg-foreground/5"></div><span class="absolute top-0 grid size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background left-0 -translate-x-1/2"><span class="size-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span></span><span class="absolute top-0 grid size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-background right-0 translate-x-1/2"><span class="size-0.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span></span></div><div class="px-6 pb-10 pt-24 md:px-12 lg:pt-40"><h2 id="approach-title" class="text-2xl font-medium leading-8 md:text-[32px] md:leading-[42px]">Design Approach</h2></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] border-x border-foreground/5 flex flex-col gap-12 px-6 pb-24 pt-12 md:px-[41px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="text-lg leading-[27px] text-foreground/80">The Weldica platform is crafted with a user-first design philosophy, ensuring an intuitive and efficient experience for welding supervisors and project managers.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8"><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Simplicity</h4><p class="text-sm">A streamlined interface with guided workflows for ease of use.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Automation</h4><p class="text-sm">Reducing manual input through AI-driven compliance validation.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Integration</h4><p class="text-sm">Seamless compatibility with industry standards and third-party documentation tools.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Visual Design</h4><p class="text-sm">Developing a clean, modern, and professional visual design that aligns with Weldica&#x27;s brand identity.</p></li><li class="rounded-[24px] border border-border/50 bg-secondary flex flex-col gap-2 px-[25px] py-[39px] leading-[22px]"><h4 class="text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground">Transparency</h4><p class="text-sm">Clear status tracking of welding procedures, testing, and cert